OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: Mozart
OL,6,     FKate Molleson explores the
OL,7,     Frelationships that shaped Mozart's
OL,8,     Flife and work, looking today at
OL,9,     Fthe brotherhood of Freemasons.
OL,10,G1700 In Tune
OL,11,     FCallum Smart and Richard Uttley
OL,12,     Fplay live. Laurence Perkins on his
OL,13,     FWylde Britain project.
OL,14,G1900 BBC Proms 2026
OL,15,     FLive at the BBC Proms: BBC
OL,16,     FSymphony Orchestra and Chorus,
OL,17,     Fconductor Nil Venditti and star
OL,18,     Fsoloists perform Rossini's Stabat
OL,19,     FMater. Respighi's Church Windows
OL,20,     Flight the first half.
